## Source data — not covered, and not redistributed

None of the geographic data ships with this repository (`data/` is
gitignored and fetched at build time), so nothing here relicenses it.
Every source is US Government or Natural Earth public domain and
requires no attribution; `NOTES.md` has the complete inventory with URLs
and cache paths. Courtesy credit, if you print this for others:

- Elevation: Mapzen/Nextzen terrain tiles on AWS Open Data, derived from
  USGS 3DEP and SRTM
- Coastline and state boundary: US Census cartographic boundary files
- International and state lines: Natural Earth
- Geomorphic provinces: California Geological Survey
- Hydrography: USGS Small-Scale Dataset
